From 851ceca3cc1194d962fd256d76b8a527d3a9ad7a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Tamir Duberstein <tamird@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 13:12:01 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] Expose the native Buildifier executable for build actions

The public Buildifier target runs a script so that bazel run starts in
the caller's workspace. A build action needs Buildifier to run in the
action's working directory, even on a worker with no shell. Selecting
the download directly would require the caller to repeat the project's
platform mapping.

Expose the executable from the resolved toolchain as
//buildifier:native. The existing CLI keeps its workspace behavior.
---
 README.md                        | 4 ++++
 buildifier/BUILD                 | 8 ++++++++
 buildifier/buildifier_binary.bzl | 1 +
 3 files changed, 13 insertions(+)

diff --git a/README.md b/README.md
index 6ae36e5..56596f1 100644
--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -38,6 +38,10 @@ bazel run -- @buildifier_prebuilt//:buildozer ARGS
 bazel run -- @buildifier_prebuilt//:buildifier ARGS
 ```
 
+For a Bazel build action, use `@buildifier_prebuilt//buildifier:native`
+as the executable tool. It provides the binary for the execution
+platform without starting a shell or changing the working directory.
+
 ## Installation
 
 Check [the releases](releases) page for the latest snippet.
diff --git a/buildifier/BUILD b/buildifier/BUILD
index 69ffb5b..9b52784 100644
--- a/buildifier/BUILD
+++ b/buildifier/BUILD
@@ -20,6 +20,14 @@ buildifier_binary(
     visibility = ["//visibility:public"],
 )
 
+# Native executable for build actions; the interactive CLI changes directory.
+filegroup(
+    name = "native",
+    srcs = [":buildifier"],
+    output_group = "native_binary",
+    visibility = ["//visibility:public"],
+)
+
 filegroup(
     name = "all_files",
     srcs = glob(["*"]),
diff --git a/buildifier/buildifier_binary.bzl b/buildifier/buildifier_binary.bzl
index 753dc93..1569e48 100644
--- a/buildifier/buildifier_binary.bzl
+++ b/buildifier/buildifier_binary.bzl
@@ -27,6 +27,7 @@ def _buildifier_binary(ctx):
             runfiles = ctx.runfiles(files = [buildifier]),
             executable = script,
         ),
+        OutputGroupInfo(native_binary = depset([buildifier])),
     ]
 
 buildifier_binary = rule(
-- 
